 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's exports to Germany and France have both increased over the last 10 years.",
  "Exports to Germany grew from 3.18 billion euros in 2016 to 3.91 billion euros in 2025, a 23.2% increase.",
  "Exports to France rose from 2.19 billion euros in 2016 to 3.10 billion euros in 2025, a larger increase of 41.8%.",
  "Exports to Germany peaked in 2022 at 4.24 billion euros, while exports to France reached their peak in 2025 at 3.10 billion euros.",
  "The data are in current euros and do not account for inflation or price changes over time."
 ],
